# The tools the publishing workflow installs from PyPI to build the package, at the
# versions we have reviewed. These are also the versions the package is checked with
# before each release. publish.txt pins them and everything they depend on, with the
# SHA-256 of each file. To upgrade, change a version here and regenerate it with:
#   uv pip compile --universal --python-version 3.12 --generate-hashes \
#     .github/requirements/publish.in -o .github/requirements/publish.txt
